# Indexed-long cst load fusion (#121 follow-up): const_array[i] must
# read through absolute long indexed addressing (one instruction, the
# hardware adds X to the full 24-bit address) — not the [tcc__r9] far
# setup, and never the bank-blind lda.w/lda.l $0000,x forms.

in byteidx: present lda\.l romtab,x
in wordidx: present lda\.l romtab16,x
absent tcc__r9
